# ─── Trafikcloud — Production Environment Template ─────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.production.local (recommended) or .env.production on the build
# machine / CI runner and fill in real values before running `pnpm build`.
# Both filenames are gitignored (see .gitignore) — never commit real values.
#
# Per the Production Environment Audit, the following variables from
# apps/web/.env.example are deliberately NOT carried into this production
# template: VITE_STUDENT_APP_URL, VITE_FEATURE_BANKID,
# VITE_FEATURE_AI_ASSISTANT, VITE_FEATURE_CORPORATE_PORTAL,
# VITE_FEATURE_MOBILE_APP, VITE_ENABLE_QUERY_DEVTOOLS,
# VITE_ENABLE_DEBUG_LOGGING. None of them are read anywhere in application
# code (confirmed by a repo-wide search) — reintroduce a variable here only
# once real code reads it.
#
# CORRECTION: VITE_APP_URL was previously in that excluded list too, but is
# actually read (apps/web/src/modules/settings/routes/CompanySettingsPage.tsx
# — displays the tenant's own public catalog/booking URL to the admin).
# Re-added below; without it that helper text silently renders without a
# domain prefix rather than breaking outright, but it should still be set.
#
# OPEN QUESTION (not resolved by this file): confirm whether production
# uses the same Supabase project as development (ulgsndzfksphquqakelq — the
# only project ref found anywhere in this repo) or a new, separate
# production project. This materially changes the value below and is a
# decision this sprint does not make.

# ─── Supabase ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dashboard → Project Settings → API, for whichever project is designated
# production.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<production-project-ref>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<production-anon-key>

# ─── Application ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_APP_URL=https://trafikcloud.se
VITE_APP_ENV=production
# Keep in sync with the deployed release (git tag / package.json version).
# No CI step currently bumps this automatically — set it by hand per deploy
# until one exists.
VITE_APP_VERSION=<release-version>

# ─── Error Monitoring (Sentry) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave empty until a Sentry project exists — monitoring never initializes
# without a DSN, and never outside a production build regardless
# (apps/web/src/core/monitoring/index.ts).
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=<sentry-dsn-or-leave-empty>

# ─── Maps (Google Maps Embed API) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave empty until a key exists — the branch-location map (Inställningar →
# Platser) never renders without one (apps/web/src/shared/components/
# GoogleLocationMap.tsx). Google Cloud Console → Credentials → create a
# browser key restricted by HTTP referrer (trafikcloud.se, *.trafikcloud.se)
# and restricted to the Maps Embed API only. Platform-level value — never a
# tenant credential, never stored in organizations.settings.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<google-maps-browser-key-or-leave-empty>
